<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan's BSPA buys 54,000T U.S. soybeans at tender.</title>
<headline>Taiwan's BSPA buys 54,000T U.S. soybeans at tender.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Taichung division of Taiwan's Breakfast Soybean Procurement Association (BSPA) bought a 54,000-tonne shipment of U.S. soybeans from U.S. Bunge at a tender on Friday, traders said.</p>
